Recommends: snapraid
Description: Nimbus Control Center: apps, VMs and storage in one window
 The local web app of NimbusOS, served on 127.0.0.1:7777 and opened as its
 own window:
  - dashboard with live CPU, memory, disk and network use per app and VM,
    and alerts;
  - app store: one-click Docker Compose apps from the NimbusOS catalog;
  - virtual machines on KVM/QEMU with embedded consoles;
  - storage: disks, a mergerfs pool with optional SnapRAID parity, SMB
    shares and SMB users;
  - NimbusOS updates.
 .
 The backend runs as the unprivileged nimbus-control user. Privileged work
 goes through nimbus-privd, a root helper with a fixed list of actions
 that only nimbus-control may call. Purging this package removes its own
 settings and caches but never app data, VM disks, shares, SMB users or
 disk mounts.
